{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/2f527f163b5f798ac6a47106befb59c0.avif?t=1758363440\" width=640 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Yamato, Tsubame and the other members of the recently formed Imperial Summoner Academy's hero class and\u00a0embark on a mystical adventure across the world of O-Yashima. A nostalgic although surreal world mixing fantasy, Sci-Fi and traditional Japan, illustrated with impressive hand drawn graphics and animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>KAMIYOGATARI</strong></i> puts you back into the golden age of 2D JRPGs and side-scrolling action while featuring a unique style of Action-RPG combining strategic use of magical battle techniques and high-speed frenetic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team of summoners and magical spirits, and overcome the various\u00a0challenges awaiting you throughout your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/659a4fd00ad78da7c97e09b39d0b4268.poster.avif?t=1758363440\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/659a4fd00ad78da7c97e09b39d0b4268.webm?t=1758363440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/659a4fd00ad78da7c97e09b39d0b4268.mp4?t=1758363440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music is also an essential part of any great RPG.\u00a0Experience the world of O-Yashima throughout a stunning score composed by legendary JRPG composers dream-team including <strong>Motoi Sakuraba</strong> and <strong>Hiroki Kikuta</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many Heroes, many possibilities:</strong>\u00a0 Yamato, Tsubame and the other summoners of the hero class, each have their own abilities and playstyle you'll have to switch between or combine according to the situation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/4acd714b00b749b82acb523c462b23d5.poster.avif?t=1758363440\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/4acd714b00b749b82acb523c462b23d5.webm?t=1758363440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/4acd714b00b749b82acb523c462b23d5.mp4?t=1758363440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Spirits:</strong> As a summoner you'll meet and befriend many magical Spirits\u00a0throughout your journey. Each of them having their own set of techniques and skills which would further\u00a0increase your range of possibilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/51ab637b32c808e48d8b8852b640f1f4.poster.avif?t=1758363440\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/51ab637b32c808e48d8b8852b640f1f4.webm?t=1758363440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/51ab637b32c808e48d8b8852b640f1f4.mp4?t=1758363440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> A vibrant RPG focused on vibrant characters: </strong>Experience a deep story unfolding around unique characters portrayed with colorful 2D hand-drawn graphics and detailled animations!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/237ac0e659b699e9ed09abb3fcb0349a.poster.avif?t=1758363440\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/237ac0e659b699e9ed09abb3fcb0349a.webm?t=1758363440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/237ac0e659b699e9ed09abb3fcb0349a.mp4?t=1758363440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Giant monsters, deadly mechas and powerful rivals will test your skills and wits at each stage of your journey. Even the strongest enemy has its weakness, would you be able to find it?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/e950683747d8a7ba236055b6f9a54514.poster.avif?t=1758363440\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/e950683747d8a7ba236055b6f9a54514.webm?t=1758363440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987370/extras/e950683747d8a7ba236055b6f9a54514.mp4?t=1758363440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987370?t=1758363440","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987370?t=1758363440","capsule_i